  "body": "**Link to problem area**:\r\n\r\nhttps://spec.matrix.org/v1.6/client-server-api/#put_matrixclientv3useruseridroomsroomidtagstag\r\n\r\n**Issue**\r\n\r\nIt seems that order is really an optional field, I have a bunch of rooms with no tag metadata\r\n<img width=\"255\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2403652/235109110-9521965e-9ca9-4487-b86a-849223eb84a4.png\">\r\n\r\nIs the spec wrong? Should the field be optional? The js-sdk types demand `order` which causes react-sdk type fails in strict mode.\r\n",
